categories = Settings categories
clear-the-filter-hint = Clear what is typed
filter-placeholder = Find a setting…
revert-hint = Put this back to what Resonate was built with, and take the key out of the settings file
experimental = Experimental
reset-hint = Put every setting in this category back to what Resonate was built with
nothing-found = No setting answers to that.
nothing-found-more = A setting is found by its name, by the words its hint uses, or by what other players call it.
found = Found
settings-found = { $count ->
